    "hadith": {
      "arabic": "مَا أَنْفَقَ أَحَدٌ نَفَقَةً قَطُّ فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ إِلَّا بَدَّلَهَا اللَّهُ خَيْرًا مِنْهَا",
      "english": "No one ever gives in charity a gift from Allah’s wealth, but Allah will replace it with something better.",
      "source": "Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim 993",
